# Red and black mana cannot pay Circle of Protection: White's {W} (CR 601.2h); with white it is cast. Its ability can be
# activated with no damage to prevent and resolves (the ruling: "Can be used even when there is no damage to prevent";
# CR 609.7a). The Circle is itself a white permanent, and a source need not be able to deal damage to be a legal
# choice (the ruling), so it is the one source offered: colorless Ornithopter is refused (CR 105.2).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Circle of Protection: White
Ornithopter
Island x20

